Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|false|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|test.run.environment|CE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Localization Hooks|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG
		|localization|JA|

Scenario: Localization JA Hook Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|hook.plugins.includes|localization-ja-hook|
	When these variables
		|appName|Japanese Localization|
	And these variables
		|portletName|localization-ja-hook|
	Then OSGiSmoke Smoke
		|appName|${portletName}|
		|portletName|${portletName}|